{
  "openapi": "3.0.3",
  "info": {
    "title": "Synbio Orders API",
    "version": "1.0.0",
    "description": "API for submitting and managing Synthetic Biology product orders at Twist Bioscience.\n\nThis API supports ordering of various synbio products including:\n- **Clonal Genes**: Clonal gene products with vector selection\n- **Fragments**: Custom gene fragment synthesis with adapters and order settings\n- **High Mass DNA**: Large-scale DNA synthesis orders\n\n## Order Flow\n1. **Create Draft**: Create a draft for your selected product type\n   - `POST /v1/clonal-genes/drafts`\n   - `POST /v1/fragments/drafts`\n   - `POST /v1/high-mass-dna/drafts`\n2. **Retrieve Draft**: Get draft details with validation results\n   - `GET /v1/users/{email}/clonal-genes/drafts/{draft-id}`\n   - `GET /v1/users/{email}/fragments/drafts/{draft-id}`\n   - `GET /v1/users/{email}/high-mass-dna/drafts/{draft-id}`\n3. **Discover Order Settings** (Fragments only):\n   - `GET /v1/users/{email}/fragments/order-settings` \u2014 catalog of available options\n   - Pass desired settings in `orderSettings` when creating or updating the draft\n4. **Request Quote**: `POST /v1/quotes/{draft-id}`\n5. **Place Order**: `POST /v1/orders/{draft-id}`\n   - Returns `salesOrderId` synchronously\n\n## Vectors (Clonal Genes)\nClonal gene items require a vector and insertion site. Use the vectors endpoint\nto retrieve vectors available for the user, then reference them by ID when\ncreating a draft.\n\n## Adapters (Fragments)\nFragments drafts support an `adapters` flag at the draft level. When enabled,\nuniversal adapters are applied to all sequences in the draft, which affects\npricing, scoring, and validation.\n\n## Order Settings (Fragments)\nFragments drafts support configurable order settings (delivery format, buffer,\nnormalization, capping, shipment) at the draft level. Use the\n`GET /v1/users/{email}/fragments/order-settings` catalog endpoint to discover\navailable options before creating a draft. Pass the chosen values in the\n`orderSettings` field when creating the draft.\n\nThe catalog returns a list of delivery format options. Each delivery format\ncontains `sections` that group related settings (e.g. \"Additional Materials\",\n\"Production\", \"Delivery\"). Each section contains `components` with selectable\n`options`. Use the `attribute` and `value` from each selected option to\npopulate the `orderSettings` object on the draft.\n\n## Authentication\nAll endpoints require authentication using the Bearer Token scheme.\n\nIf you have an existing JWT: You can reuse this token, simply replace the JWT prefix with the keyword Bearer.\n\n## Available Servers\n- **Staging**: `https://api.twistbioscience.com/staging-synbio-intake/`\n- **Production**: `https://api.twistbioscience.com/ecommerce-synbio-intake/`\n",
    "x-jentic-source-url": "https://api.swaggerhub.com/apis/TwistDNA/synbio-order-intake/1.0.0"
  },
  "servers": [
    {
      "url": "https://api.twistbioscience.com/staging-synbio-intake/",
      "description": "Staging Environment"
    },
    {
      "url": "https://api.twistbioscience.com/ecommerce-synbio-intake/",
      "description": "Production Environment"
    }
  ],
  "security": [
    {
      "bearerAuth": []
    }
  ],
  "tags": [
    {
      "name": "Clonal Genes",
      "description": "Clonal gene draft management and vector metadata"
    },
    {
      "name": "Fragments",
      "description": "Gene fragment draft management and order settings"
    },
    {
      "name": "High Mass DNA",
      "description": "High Mass DNA draft management"
    },
    {
      "name": "Quotes",
      "description": "Quote generation"
    },
    {
      "name": "Orders",
      "description": "Order placement"
    }
  ],
  "paths": {
    "/v1/users/{email}/clonal-genes/vectors": {
      "get": {
        "tags": [
          "Clonal Genes"
        ],
        "summary": "List Vectors",
        "description": "Retrieve vectors available for the user. These vectors are used when\ncreating clonal gene drafts \u2014 each item must reference a `vectorId`\nand an `insertionSiteId` from the chosen vector.\n",
        "operationId": "listVectors",
        "parameters": [
          {
            "$ref": "#/components/parameters/email"
          }
        ],
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "Vectors retrieved successfully.",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "type": "array",
                  "items": {
                    "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Vector"
                  }
                },
                "examples": {
                  "vectors": {
                    "summary": "Available vectors",
                    "value": [
                      {
                        "id": 101,
                        "name": "pTwist Amp High Copy",
                        "description": "High copy number cloning vector",
                        "type": "catalog",
                        "usage": "cloning",
                        "targetYieldEligible": true,
                        "polyaQcEligible": false,
                        "insertionSites": [
                          {
                            "id": 201,
                            "name": "MCS",
                            "express": false
                          },
                          {
                            "id": 202,
                            "name": "T7 Express",
                            "express": true
                          }
                        ]
                      },
                      {
                        "id": 102,
                        "name": "pTwist CMV",
                        "description": "Mammalian expression vector",
                        "type": "catalog",
                        "usage": "expression",
                        "targetYieldEligible": false,
                        "polyaQcEligible": true,
                        "insertionSites": [
                          {
                            "id": 301,
                            "name": "CMV Site",
                            "express": true
                          }
                        ]
                      }
                    ]
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "500": {
            "$ref": "#/components/responses/InternalError"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "/v1/clonal-genes/drafts": {
      "post": {
        "tags": [
          "Clonal Genes"
        ],
        "summary": "Create Clonal Genes Draft",
        "description": "Create a draft for clonal gene products.\nEach item must reference a `vectorId` and `insertionSiteId` obtained\nfrom the vectors endpoint.\nValidates the payload and sequences, returning a draft ID.\n",
        "operationId": "createClonalGenesDraft",
        "requestBody": {
          "required": true,
          "content": {
            "application/json": {
              "schema": {
                "$ref": "#/components/schemas/CreateClonalGenesDraftRequest"
              },
              "examples": {
                "basic": {
                  "summary": "Basic clonal genes draft",
                  "value": {
                    "email": "user@twistbioscience.com",
                    "externalOrderId": "EXT-ORD-004",
                    "items": [
                      {
                        "externalId": "CG-001",
                        "name": "Clonal Gene 1",
                        "sequence": "ATGCGATCGATCGATCGATCGATCG",
                        "organism": "E. coli",
                        "vectorId": 101,
                        "insertionSiteId": 201
                      }
                    ]
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          }
        },
        "responses": {
          "201": {
            "description": "Draft created successfully.",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/DraftCreatedResponse"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "400": {
            "$ref": "#/components/responses/BadRequest"
          },
          "500": {
            "$ref": "#/components/responses/InternalError"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "/v1/users/{email}/clonal-genes/drafts/{draft-id}": {
      "get": {
        "tags": [
          "Clonal Genes"
        ],
        "summary": "Retrieve Clonal Genes Draft",
        "description": "Retrieve a clonal genes draft by ID, including item-level validation results.\n",
        "operationId": "getClonalGenesDraft",
        "parameters": [
          {
            "$ref": "#/components/parameters/email"
          },
          {
            "$ref": "#/components/parameters/draftId"
          }
        ],
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "Draft retrieved successfully.",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ClonalGenesDraftResponse"
                },
                "examples": {
                  "draft_no_errors": {
                    "summary": "Draft without errors",
                    "value": {
                      "draftId": "draft-345678",
                      "email": "user@twistbioscience.com",
                      "status": "DRAFT",
                      "externalOrderId": "EXT-ORD-004",
                      "items": [
                        {
                          "id": "item-020",
                          "externalId": "CG-001",
                          "name": "Clonal Gene 1",
                          "sequence": "ATGCGATCGATCGATCGATCGATCG",
                          "organism": "E. coli",
                          "vectorId": 101,
                          "insertionSiteId": 201,
                          "errors": []
                        }
                      ]
                    }
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "404": {
            "$ref": "#/components/responses/NotFound"
          },
          "500": {
            "$ref": "#/components/responses/InternalError"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "/v1/users/{email}/fragments/order-settings": {
      "get": {
        "tags": [
          "Fragments"
        ],
        "summary": "Get Fragment Order Settings Catalog",
        "description": "Retrieve the available order settings options for fragment drafts.\nUse this before creating a draft to know which values can be set on\n`orderSettings`.\n\nReturns a list of delivery format options. Each delivery format contains\n`sections` grouping related settings (e.g. \"Additional Materials\",\n\"Production\", \"Delivery\"). Each section contains `components` with\nselectable `options`. Use the `attribute` and `value` from each\nselected option to populate the `orderSettings` object on the draft.\n",
        "operationId": "getFragmentOrderSettingsCatalog",
        "parameters": [
          {
            "$ref": "#/components/parameters/email"
          }
        ],
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "Order settings catalog retrieved successfully.",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "type": "array",
                  "items": {
                    "$ref": "#/components/schemas/OrderSettingsDeliveryFormat"
